# Default gbtgridder options for doall -g (one option per line or space separated; # comments).
# doall supplies the SDFITS files, --restfreq (from input.tab) and --output.
# Do NOT pass --scans here: scan numbers overlap between sessions, and pelican.py
# has already selected the scans when writing each SDFITS file.
--mapcenter 312.783625 44.44313889
--clobber
